From {{inh|en|enm|pool}}, {{m|enm|pole}}, {{m|enm|pol}}, from {{inh|en|ang|pōl|t=pool}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|pōl}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*pōlaz|t=pool, pond}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*bōlos|t=bog, marsh}}. 

