From {{inh|en|enm|preiere}}, from {{der|en|fro|preiere}}, from {{der|en|la-eme|precāria}}, derived from {{der|en|la|prex|precem}}. Displaced native {{ncog|ang|ġebed}} (whence modern {{ncog|en|bead}}).

