#: {{ux|en|For Baha'is, there's a difference between obligatory '''prayers''' and devotional '''prayers'''.}}
# A [[meeting]] held for the express purpose of [[pray]]ing.
#: {{ux|en|Grandpa never misses a chance to go to '''prayer'''.}}
